# Phase 7: integrate: dc dec/list and step list on Spectre/VACASK
# (render::named, capability DcLogList/StepList). A `.dc` axis by decade,
# octave or list (Xyce RG `.DC`, LTspice `.dc`, HSPICE `.DC … DEC|POI`) is
# its values, start·10^(k/n) (or 2^) to stop or the list as written: Spectre
# `dc`/`sweep … values=[…]` (Reference 19.1 pp.406-409), VACASK `sweep …
# values=[…]` (lib/answeep.cpp setupValueSweep); a list `.step` is Spectre's
# `sweep param=p values=[…]` and VACASK's value sweep of its control var
# (`temp` the `option="temp"`). Oracle: VACASK runs against the closed forms
# (test_vacask_runs), Spectre text by clause. Per set: hspice 4, ltspice 34, xyce 223.
