# Phase 7: spice-write: Xyce options (CONFORMANCE-GAPS W0017). An option with
# a Xyce Reference Guide spelling is written in its package (ABSTOL is NONLIN
# ABSTOL; METHOD trap|gear, MAXORD, DELMAX are TIMEINT's; SCALE is PARSER's,
# a bare `parser` before it its package word), an option that shapes only
# the listing or the output (ACCT, NOACCT, LIST, NODE, NOPAGE, NUMDGT, POST,
# …) is left out (W0024), where the old writer refused the deck; VNTOL, a
# voltage update tolerance the old writer spelled NONLIN ABSTOL (a residual
# current one), is refused. Xyce 7.10 `-norun` reads every written deck
# below without an unknown-option warning.
