# Phase 7: spice-write: Xyce prints on ngspice, sdt, files inside a subcircuit.
# ngspice-45's `.print` takes a kind the deck runs and bare outputs: a
# braced expression is written bare ("no such function as {v" before), a
# print of a kind no analysis runs (Xyce's homotopy, AC_IC, `.print dc`
# beside `.op`) and Xyce's power accessors p()/w() ("analysis not run") are
# left out (W0023). Xyce's sdt() has no ngspice spelling (manual §5.1: ddt,
# no integral): refused W0045. A .include/.lib inside a .subckt of another
# dialect's deck is refused on Xyce (W0046): Xyce 7.10 defines its content
# globally (ex1b: 0.8 V on Xyce, 1.0 V on ngspice).
spice-bench/ngspice/tests/regression/lib-processing/ex1b.sp xyce refused W0046: .lib inside .subckt sub1 (Xyce makes sub_in_lib global; 0.8 V vs ngspice 1.0 V)
xyce/ABM/sdt.cir ngspice refused W0045: sdt() (ngspice has no time integral)
xyce/ABM/sdt.cir espice refused W0045: sdt() (ngspice's family)
spice-bench/ngspice/tests/general/mosmem.sp ngspice .print spelled for ngspice: braced outputs bare, a kind not run or p()/w() left out (W0023)
