# Phase 7: spice-write: if() on ngspice. Xyce's and LTspice's if(c,a,b) is
# ((c)?(a):(b)) on ngspice and ESPice: ngspice-45 has no if ("no such
# function 'if'" in a B source, "Cannot compute substitute" in {}). Real
# ngspice on the written xyce/TERNARY_OP deck: its 14 ternary/if() pairs
# agree at all 51 .dc points (that deck is listed above).
xyce/ABM_BREAK/break.cir espice if(c,a,b) written ((c)?(a):(b))
xyce/ABM_BREAK/break.cir ngspice if(c,a,b) written ((c)?(a):(b))
xyce/ACtests/test1.cir espice if(c,a,b) written ((c)?(a):(b))
xyce/ACtests/test1.cir ngspice if(c,a,b) written ((c)?(a):(b))
xyce/PARSER/nakedIf.cir espice if(c,a,b) written ((c)?(a):(b))
xyce/UNARYOPS/unary_funcs.cir espice if(c,a,b) written ((c)?(a):(b))
xyce/UNARYOPS/unary_funcs.cir ngspice if(c,a,b) written ((c)?(a):(b))

