# Phase 7: spice-read: LTspice C/L parasitics as elements (spice/parasitics.rs,
# spice/cards.rs Rcl arm). On ngspice, ESPice, HSPICE and Xyce an LTspice
# C's or L's Rser/Lser (series, on internal nodes `{decl}_s1`, `_s2`) and
# Rpar/Cpar (across the card's nodes) are written as R, L, C elements, the
# part's ratings (V, Irms, Ipk, mfg, pn, type, pppkg, mtbf) left out; the
# implicit Rser=1m of an uncoupled L likewise. No golden line: every
# LTspice deck holding one is still refused on those targets (W0005,
# W0037), compared by status only.

