# Phase 7: spectre-read-r2: VACASK script lines (render::read::named_bench
# vacask_control, refused kept_construct; W0120 new). A VACASK control
# command with no circuit meaning (`abort`, `print`, `postprocess`: VACASK
# docs cmd-errorhandling.md, cmd-print.md, cmd-postprocess.md) and an
# `embed` of a file no `load`/`include` reads (input-embed.md) are left out
# with a W0120 note off VACASK; were copied into the SPICE and Spectre decks
# as card lines, or refused W0001 (embed). Any other control statement the
# reader keeps (`elaborate`, `alter`, `var`, an analysis it does not read)
# is refused W0001 off VACASK, was copied as a card line (S-class: hier.sim
# was written with `elaborate circuit("sub1")` as an element line). VACASK
