# Phase 7: spectre-read-r2: VACASK's own linear devices (render::read::named
# named_statement). `load "resistor.osdi"` (capacitor, inductor) loads
# VACASK's own linear R, C, L from its module path (docs/dev-vacask.md);
# the reader writes their instances as R, C, L cards, so the load is no
# load: ngspice wrote `pre_osdi resistor.osdi` ("Error opening osdi lib"),
# Spectre `ahdl_include "resistor.osdi"`, CDL an error comment. ESPice,
# HSPICE and Xyce refused the load W0004 and now write the deck. VACASK
# keeps the load (Block::own_loads): a `print device("resistor")` names
