# Phase 7: spice-read: HSPICE `.pz v(out) src` (render::read sweeps.rs
# hspice_pz) read as ngspice's `.pz in+ in- out+ out- vol|cur pz` over the
# source's nodes; HSPICE writes `.pz v(out) src` back where a source of
# the transfer's kind stands across the input pair (spice/analyses.rs
# across; capability PoleZero HSPICE cell), so an ngspice `.pz … pz` deck
# with such a source is now written for HSPICE. HSPICE `.snac`, `.sample`,
# `.ptdnoise` refuse W0015, `.vec`, `.check`, `.power` W0039 (status only).
